e59324cf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492899 #edb/ref 1074 "Either the positive or negative of the expression inside the absolute value must be equal to the right-hand side of the equation.\n\nSo, we set up the two corresponding equations and solve them independently:\n\n- If $|5-x|=5-x,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|5-x| & =6 \\\\ 5-x & =6 \\\\ -x & =1 \\\\ x & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $|5-x|=-(5-x),$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|5-x| & =6 \\\\ -(5-x) & =6 \\\\ -5+x & =6 \\\\ x & =11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=-1$ and $x=11.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492905 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186492795 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492905 #edb/ref 1069 "q-15254" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492905 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492905 #edb/ref 1071 "If $|11-4x|=3,$ then $x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492905 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "bf001cda-9f10-546a-97c2-0d9313d65e00" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492905 #edb/ref 1074 "Either the positive or negative of the expression inside the absolute value must be equal to the right-hand side of the equation.\n\nSo, we set up the two corresponding equations and solve them independently:\n\n- If $|11-4x|=11-4x,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|11-4x| & =3 \\\\ 11-4x & =3 \\\\ -4x & =-8 \\\\ \\frac{-4x}{-4} & =\\frac{-8}{-4} \\\\ x & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $|11-4x|=-(11-4x),$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|11-4x| & =3 \\\\ -(11-4x) & =3 \\\\ -11+4x & =3 \\\\ 4x & =14 \\\\ \\frac{4x}{4} & =\\frac{14}{4} \\\\ x & =\\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=2$ and $x=\\frac{7}{2}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492915 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186492819 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492915 #edb/ref 1069 "q-15257" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492915 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492915 #edb/ref 1071 "If $|5x-12|=3,$ then $x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492915 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "dc058aee-cd4e-56a4-b735-dc759e998e0e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492915 #edb/ref 1074 "Either the positive or negative of the expression inside the absolute value must be equal to the right-hand side of the equation.\n\nSo, we set up the two corresponding equations and solve them independently:\n\n- If $|5x-12|=5x-12,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|5x-12| & =3 \\\\ 5x-12 & =3 \\\\ 5x & =15 \\\\ \\frac{5x}{5} & =\\frac{15}{5} \\\\ x & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $|5x-12|=-(5x-12),$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|5x-12| & =3 \\\\ -(5x-12) & =3 \\\\ -5x+12 & =3 \\\\ -5x & =-9 \\\\ \\frac{-5x}{-5} & =\\frac{-9}{-5} \\\\ x & =\\frac{9}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=\\frac{9}{5}$ and $x=3.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492975 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a1c53633-2063-5148-ab3a-e83f6501d22e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492975 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186492899 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492987 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186493001 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492987 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b16ab395-e781-5b4b-970d-5cc8a7610c9e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492987 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186492905 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493001 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186492975 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493001 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e83a3e23-66a2-56f7-b2eb-d3f3cc24ff4f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493001 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186492915 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
